  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "文化創意產業經營與發展",
    "sub_ename": "CULTURAL CREATIVE INDUSTRY DEVELOPMENT",
    "describe_ch": "在政府與市場的雙重利基下，全球有越來越多地方型的社會事業從事文化創意產業，然而文創產業有其特定的環境條件與經營能力，本課程將從文創產業的歷史發展軌跡歸納該產業的成功經營經驗與理論，並以個案教學方式作實務應用上的研討。",
    "describe_eh": "Cultural-creative industry, motivated by governmental and market niches, becomes more and more dominant in social and local sectors. But its environmental requirements and organizational competencies are quite specific. This course will thus conclude its successful experiences in the frame of referred theories by tracking its historic evolution. Case-teaching will play the role by discussing its praxis.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
